oreover, the powerful single +12V\nrail enables non-stop usage\nwith stable and reliable performance.\n80 PLUS Gold Certified and Kaby Lake Ready\nDeliver up to 90% efficiency under real world\nload conditions to promise lowest\npower losses. Additionally, Toughpower SFX 450W Gold has been optimized to work\nwith Intel’s new 6th-generation\nKaby Lake processors to achieve maximum energy savings.\nUniversal Compact Design for All Mainstream PC\nCases – SFX to ATX PSU Adapter\nBracket\nToughpower SFX 450W Gold is designed with\ntwo-way application by the\ncompatibility of both the latest Intel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4 standard.\nToughpowr SFX Series has included a\nmatte black SFX to ATX adapter bracket which helps users easily install an SFX\npower supply into an ATX,\nMicro-ATX or Mini-ITX chassis. In addition, with the compact design, Toughpower\nSFX Series allows better airflow\ninside the chassis as well as leaves more space for users to utilize.\nZero RPM Smart Fan\nTo maximally reduce undesired noise, Toughpower\nSFX 450W Gold is designed\nwith an 80mm temperature controlled Zero RPM Smart Fan. The fan will not operate\nwhen the PSU is at low\nworking loads.\nFully Modular Low-Profile Flat Cables\nFully modular Toughpower SFX 450W Gold offers\ncable selection for users\nwhile powering the system at an advantageous voltage. Low-profile flat black\ncables can make cable\nmanagement easier, reduce clutter and increase airflow inside the chassis.\n100% High Quality Japanese Capacitors\nToughpower SFX 450W Gold features 100% high\nquality Japanese brand\ncapacitors, which greatly improves the durability and offers the highest\nstability and reliability.\nMassive and Dedicated +12V Output\nToughpower SFX 450W Gold is equipped with a powerful single +12V rail,\nplease see the output specification below:\nAC INPUT\nInput Voltage: 100V-240V\nInput Current: 3.5A-7A\nFrequency: 50Hz-60Hz\nDC OUTPUT\n+3.3V\n+5V\n+12V\n-12V\n+5Vsb\nMax Output Current\n19A\n14A\n37A\n0.3A\n2.5A\nMax Output Power\n90W\n444W\n3.6W\n12.5W\nContinuous Power\n450W\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-STP-0450FPCGUS-G\nModel\nSTP-450AH1FEG\nType\nIntel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4\nForm Factor\nSFX\nRGB Fan\nNo\nWatts\n450W\nMax Output Capacity\n450W\nPeak Output Capacity\n540W\nColor\nBlack\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 16msec at 75% of full load\nInput Current\n3.5A – 7A\nInput Frequency Range\n50Hz - 60Hz\nInput Voltage\n100V - 240V\nOperating Temperture\n0 ℃ to +40℃\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-20 ℃ to +90 ℃\nStorage Humidity\n5% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n8cm fan\nEfficiency\nMEET 80 PLUS®Gold at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n120,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nCE/FCC/UL/Bauart Mark+CB/EAC\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n2\nProtection\nOCP, OVP, OPP, SCP\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nManual\nMulti-language\n2016-05-25\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nCONTACT\nCustomer Support\nSales Partner Request\nMedia Contact\nSUPPORT\nSubmit A Request\nWarranty Policy\nHow to Find S/N\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nPress Release\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nStore Policy\nWhere to Buy\nLANGUAGE\nUnited States/Canada\nBrazil\nLatam\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nTwitter\nTwitch\nDiscord\nReddit\nCountry/region\nUSD\n$ | United States\nCAD\n$ |\nCanada\nUSD\n$ |\nUnited States\nLanguage\nEnglish\nEnglish\nFrançais\n© 2026, Thermaltake USA\nPowered by Shopify\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
